        Colordle Answer gives you today's Colordle and Colorfle answers, powerful solvers that narrow down candidates in seconds, archive lookups for any past date, and unlimited practice mode so you can sharpen your color perception every day.
      </p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:0.75rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="/today" class="btn btn-primary">Today's Answers</a>
        <a href="/colordle-solver" class="btn btn-secondary">Open Solver</a>
        <a href="/archive" class="btn btn-secondary">Browse Archive</a>
