        </div>
        <p class="card-desc">Practice Colorfle without waiting for the daily reset. Guess the three source colors using the color palette, just like the real game.</p>
        <span class="btn btn-pink" style="font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;">Play Now</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/colordle-archive" class="card" style="text-decoration:none;">
