      <div>
        <div class="author-name">Alex Rivera</div>
        <div class="author-desc">Color puzzle enthusiast. Plays Colordle and Colorfle daily. Built Colordle Answer after getting stuck at 98% one too many times.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
